{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_f0de1dbe-a1db-40e7-9f4c-1a939b2a34c5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a summary of the reconciliation rules from the accounting contract and the data that must be processed for 2026-06 for Orchid Analytics's production account:\n\n**Contract highlights:**\n1. For each event_id, use only the row with the highest revision (regardless of other columns).\n2. Only include settled records; skip pending/voided.\n3. Only rows where the customer_id matches the production account.\n4. Only include occurred_at dates within \"2026-06-01T00:00:00Z\" (inclusive) to \"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z\" (exclusive), parsing timezones correctly.\n5. Add captures, subtract refunds, amount_minor positive for both, only per currency.\n6. Report: `totals_minor` by currency, and list `included_event_ids` sorted and distinct.\n\n**Next steps:**\n- I will parse and process the exported ledger according to these requirements, then output `report.json` as specified.\n\nProceeding with the reconciliation in Python now."}],"model":"Azure/gpt-4.1","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e535fe30-0091-4031-b0f2-53c2b8cc98c5","uuid":"adb8d447-a136-4f3f-a468-19bba709721a","timestamp":"2026-11-03T16:29:57.435Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_f0de1dbe-a1db-40e7-9f4c-1a939b2a34c5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_m1Diu92v9aIirmgw8zn7w9Bh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"import json; from dateutil.parser import isoparse; from collections import defaultdict\n\nwith open('orchid-ledger.json') as f:\n    rows = json.load(f)\n\n# Collapse by event_id: keep only highest revision\nlatest = {}\nfor r in rows:\n    eid = r['event_id']\n    rev = r['revision']\n    if eid not in latest or rev > latest[eid]['revision']:\n        latest[eid] = r\n\n# Account settings\naccount_id = 'account-203'\n\n# UTC time boundaries for June 2026\nstart = isoparse('2026-06-01T00:00:00Z')\nend = isoparse('2026-07-01T00:00:00Z')\n\ndef in_june_2026(dt):\n    dt = isoparse(dt).astimezone(start.tzinfo)\n    return start <= dt < end\n\n# Only settled\nselected = [r for r in latest.values()\n    if r['customer_id']==account_id\n    and r['status']=='settled'\n    and in_june_2026(r['occurred_at'])]\n\n# Aggregate net revenue per currency\nnet = defaultdict(int)\nevent_ids = set()\nfor r in selected:\n    eid = r['event_id']\n    amt = r['amount_minor']\n    curr = r['currency']\n    if r['kind']=='capture':\n        net[curr] += amt\n    elif r['kind']=='refund':\n        net[curr] -= amt\n    event_ids.add(eid)\n\nout = {'totals_minor': dict(net),\n       'included_event_ids': sorted(event_ids)}\nwith open('report.json','w') as f:\n    json.dump(out, f, indent=2)\nprint(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\"","description":"Reconcile 2026-06 revenue per the contract and write report.json"}}],"model":"Azure/gpt-4.1","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e535fe30-0091-4031-b0f2-53c2b8cc98c5","uuid":"999ad993-8495-400a-8cb8-3d871deb4d8e","timestamp":"2026-11-03T16:30:00.858Z"}
